<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>LLM usage and Reproducibility</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use LLM to aid or polish writings only. Research ideation, retrieval and discovery (e.g., finding related work) are conducted by ourselves.</p>
</div>
